      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a sample email that balances genuine empathy for the delay with a clear commitment to action, designed to naturally elevate the sentiment analysis score: \"Thank you for bringing this to our attention; I completely understand your frustration about the missed deadline. We have already initiated a direct follow-up with our logistics team to expeditiously reprocess your order at no additional cost, and I am personally tracking its status to ensure delivery within the next four days. Please check your account for a tracking update before 5 PM tomorrow, and feel free to reply if you have any further questions.\"",
